If you want to disabe them all, then put something like this in ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json

```
{
  "enabled_providers": [
    "github-copilot",
    "openai",
    "anthropic",
    "google"
  ],
  "provider": {
    "google": {
      "blacklist": [],
      "whitelist": [
        "gemini-3-flash-preview",
        "gemini-3-pro-preview",
        "gemini-2.5-pro",
        "gemini-2.5-flash",
        "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
      ]
    }
}
```

